 * Frappe/ERPNext v16 Client Script (DocType: Purchase Order).
 *
 * Deliberately small: `editable_grid` is already on for Purchase Order Item,
 * so every visible column already renders as a live input, Tab/Shift+Tab/
 * Up/Down already move between real cells, and "Configure Columns" (the
 * grid header's gear icon) already handles column order/width/sticky,
 * persisted per-user server-side. None of that is reimplemented here.
 *
 * This script only adds what the native grid does not provide:
 *  - comfortable minimum column widths + horizontal scroll, so the ~19
 *    visible columns (see aimatic Purchase Order Item field layout) don't
 *    get squeezed into Frappe's default Bootstrap-fraction sizing
 *  - a live totals footer (Qty / Trade Offer / Amount)
 *  - a fullscreen toggle for entering long item lists
