 * text for live inputs, reformatting values, etc.) on practically every
 * field change - not just the handful of events this script listens to
 * directly. Every one of those re-renders can wipe the inline widths set
 * below back to Frappe's own default sizing. A MutationObserver on the
 * grid body re-applies widths after *any* such change so the header and
 * body columns can never drift out of alignment (this is what caused the
